Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)就代替陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收下这家伙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.11,0:00:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想救这家伙的话就去问卡片吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙会成为我们再度相会的钥匙。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.03,0:00:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)快 快斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)怎么了？发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！真月他…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.95,0:00:36.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被贝库塔带走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被带到异晶界去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 用你的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那些家伙的藏身之处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我找出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.24,0:00:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求你了 拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点 太难看了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）维克多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给我们的 这些 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}某种地图？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.18,0:01:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快开门啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！ 游马这家伙居然把我们 排挤在外！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）事已至此 计中计！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.47,0:01:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）这么说来掳走真月的就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}操纵Dr.费卡和特隆的异晶人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说那个叫贝库塔的家伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。那时候的决斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙并没有消失。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((可恶！你这混账！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(海马)原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后再次出现在了我们面前吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！有意思啊，贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.50,0:02:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算追到天涯海角我也要把你逼到绝路！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，该去哪里找？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们对巴利安的事一无所知。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！无所谓！我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟那个叫贝库塔的家伙有笔账要算。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会找到他，狠狠揍他一顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是短视的想法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(奥比塔尔7)海、海马大人！不好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们所在的塔的正上方非常强烈的重力变化。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道是 屏障！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)什 什么！？那是什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.18,0:05:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)什 什么！？这是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.61,0:05:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 皇之键里面有的…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 会出现在现实世界！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光 你…！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我们应该前往的地方我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的决斗中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔留下的 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.89,0:05:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡成为了关键
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.69,0:05:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这艘飞船启动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 还显示了指示某个地点的坐标。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地点 到底是哪里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕是 异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔似乎想让我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乘这艘飞船过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且你的朋友很可能也在那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊。那就干一场吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等。这事也太顺利了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.84,0:06:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，是害怕了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.97,0:06:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是怕了，就留下来看家吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你别太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要去救真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了这个，就算只有我一个人也要去。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.20,0:06:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在飞船正在充能。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明天早上出发。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，喂，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，那艘飞船到底是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.89,0:06:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月君在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以说了，坐飞船去救真月——
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都说了我才不会去救他！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那、那再见了，各位。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.67,0:06:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)哎？坐星光界的飞行船去？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。一个叫贝库塔的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.13,0:06:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安人把我叫过去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.77,0:06:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你遭受那种待遇{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我们的人生搞得一团糟的那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我饶不了他。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定要把他彻底打垮。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是不坦率呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.14,0:07:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我也会去的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、怎么是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.15,0:07:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经决定了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然决定了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧回去准备吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好吃了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的决斗饭 超好吃。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小步美)笨蛋 再来一碗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)怎、怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟平时没什么两样就是了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.05,0:07:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶 一直以来谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.89,0:07:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 姐姐 工作很忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 什、什么啊 突然这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我帮你揉揉肩吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等、等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 奶奶和小步美也待会儿再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.39,0:08:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你那里得到的用这张卡，我一定会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Astral。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.56,0:08:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想你应该明白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗会非常艰难。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是我无论如何都想救真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以这场决斗我绝对不能输。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说，奶奶。怎么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马那家伙有点不对劲？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，不知道他在打什么主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那孩子，跟一马简直一模一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每次要去冒那种极其危险的险时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马也总是那副样子呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那家伙。我去问一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是守护那个孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.17,0:09:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春人)哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.74,0:09:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 你要去了吧。要去和巴利安战斗对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起 都是为了我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不只是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场战斗 也是为了给我自己做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.21,0:09:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事。我不会输的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且一定会回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 说好了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大…大家。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.38,0:09:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 都忘了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.82,0:09:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:09:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋 小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶 我出门了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.24,0:10:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晚饭之前要好好回来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姐姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 我走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！大家来得真早啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 是你太慢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说 妹妹鲨鱼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 连你也来这里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别叫我妹妹鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信一定能帮上忙的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 这样可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她一旦说出口就不会听劝了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿 可靠的伙伴都到齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 随时都能出发哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～ 那就走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃 不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要怎么进去啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这个闪光传送器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能进入心之坑里。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦～！ 什 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们 为什么在这里…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.72,0:11:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抢先一步也太不够意思了喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)就是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马不吭声就自己去也太见外了啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 把你们卷进来可不行…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.99,0:11:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也一样想救真月啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.09,0:11:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月他对我们来说也是重要的朋友哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 出发吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这里就是心之座！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 好厉害～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.89,0:11:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标坐标 确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在起 这艘船将要出港。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也能看见星光体的样子呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:12:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发射程序 开始。全系统 上线。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主动力 接通。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:07.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认全系统 正常运转。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你来下达指示。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎 我来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次就让你出出风头吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快点做啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）发射准备 完毕。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5 4 3 2 1…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发射！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.10,0:12:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦哦～ 飞起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.51,0:12:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)异次元之门 开启。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在开始 突入异次元空间！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 来吧 放马过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.66,0:13:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)目前正朝着目标坐标
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顺利航行中。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是异次元隧道。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好安静啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 太安静了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了 我带了零食来哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.47,0:13:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也带了 奶奶做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗饭 给我做好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好～嘞 大家一起吃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 当郊游了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奶奶的决斗饭是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么情况 这冲击是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.06,0:13:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞艇前方确认到大量未确认物体。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……怪物！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}左舷也密密麻麻地挤满了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）这边也有！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）被包围了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗鲨，上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也上！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，鲨鱼龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，零鸟兽西尔菲涅！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，布里奇大公！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.62,0:14:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～霍普！霍普剑斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（离绪）冰之射线！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，怎么样！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:14:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:14:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太没手感了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.56,0:15:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)你到底想干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不好了！船的航线上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.67,0:15:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出现了一个巨大的黑洞。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.31,0:15:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 游马… 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但好像不是异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《可是 这个地方…》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)欢迎来到沙尔加索！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等你好久了 九十九游马还有 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽来迎接你们玩得还开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 那家伙是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是哪里!? 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.24,0:16:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异世界的墓地 萨尔加索。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们最后看到的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 真月呢… 真月在哪里!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那么想见他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让你们见见吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你们的朋友一起。啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.73,0:16:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 真月！真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 你这混蛋！你对真月做了什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾 你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也不会醒来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧… 怎么会… 骗人的吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((真月:九十九游马君
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是WDC的冠军{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.52,0:17:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是九十九游马君吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我决斗虽然很菜但我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别丢下我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！ 我这是为你好))
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会… 真月君…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:41.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)你就是神代凌牙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是谁啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是将你以决斗击倒之人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.33,0:17:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为我亲手打倒的巴利安之一{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把你的名字刻在我这胸口上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)好久不见了 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)米扎艾尔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天就来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.03,0:18:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底谁才是真正的银河眼使用者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.18,0:18:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求之不得 米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.36,0:18:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好了 别那么伤心嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们也很快就能见到这家伙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为从这里活着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是回不去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可原谅……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不可原谅，贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要把你击溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.05,0:19:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D·盖泽 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.90,0:19:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 哥布林德伯格！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.13,0:19:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌把 等级4以下的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.25,0:19:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 我我我骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的哥布林德巴格和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}顽皮骑士来超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.71,0:19:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:05.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 一上来就召唤王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.25,0:20:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你没什么余裕啊 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我理解你的心情 但冷静点。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤双鳍鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)并且 当我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 双鳍鲨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.39,0:20:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在作为超量素材时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.44,0:20:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只可以当作2只使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的双鳍鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用沉默的安格拉进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咆哮吧，No.32！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海咬龙 鲨龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.34,0:21:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将光子斩击者特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自身场上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，召唤光子三角翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的光子斩击者和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.24,0:21:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子三角翼进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，辉光帝 银河光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法 异次元的古战场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}萨尔加索的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.33,0:21:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.19,0:22:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.49,0:22:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 这个场地是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
